{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through a blight-infected world in this monster-filled, action-packed, 2D souls-inspired rogue-lite game.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage a wide variety of formidable enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight using combat reminiscent of the Souls series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront escalating challenges in infinite New Game+ story mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890310/extras/25a2767391643a9814836079b1ff2b3c.poster.avif?t=1769867346\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890310/extras/25a2767391643a9814836079b1ff2b3c.webm?t=1769867346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All weapons are one handed, wear Sword, Daggers, Wands or Shield on any hand  to create a unique build. (Shields are only left handed)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 50 weapons, each with unique skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply status effects on any enemy, including bosses. Such as Bleed, Poison, Burn, Freeze, Shock, Choke, Shatter, Life Splash, Darkness or Light Struck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tons of blessings, unique items that modifies your character builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance your character\u2019s level to unlock a large variety of weapons, gear, and blessings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently upgrade your character and unlock additional options in future runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890310/extras/db5f56942b45ab11475b1fa5e7db0d8b.poster.avif?t=1769867346\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890310/extras/db5f56942b45ab11475b1fa5e7db0d8b.webm?t=1769867346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through 3 randomly generated maps. With unique enemies, backgrounds and random encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find random encounters that give unique rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find chests full of blessings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a shop where you can acquire weapons, gear and blessings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your health, mana or stamina by praying to the statue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a blacksmith to smelt spare gear to upgrade your equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890310/extras/5d73470e3c888061f4bbd0395c3c9c3a.poster.avif?t=1769867346\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890310/extras/5d73470e3c888061f4bbd0395c3c9c3a.webm?t=1769867346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1890310?t=1769867346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890310/be54b19b54dab7ba391d9f31712a7f8f1d61e7b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769867346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890310/a36ac6dcb00402417d47279