310/ss_a519aaa64d5bbf5ecfb1c9753e9358cd833a801f.600x338.jpg?t=1769867346"}],"short_description":"Rogue Blight is a souls-like, rogue-lite, combat focused RPG. Fight your way through ever-changing maps. Customize your playstyle based on what you find. Meet other struggling heroes. Death will be punishing, but you will get stronger with every journey. Are you up for the challenge?","steam_appid":1890310,"support_info":{"email":"help@coderadgames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Hungarian, Russian","type":"game","website":"https://www.coderadgames.com"}